","e":"mpwr","d":"2021-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Matt Ramsay","x":"And secondly, with the pricing environment that we're feeling today, how do you guys think about price increases going forward relative to input costs and what that could mean to margins?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2021 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"I think that most people have recognized within the semiconductors and even specific to analog that, that created an opportunity for many companies to affect price increases with their customers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2021 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-02-10","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"And so now as we look at 2022, we are going to implement selective but more broad-based price increases, but they will be at a more modest level than some of our peer companies have implemented.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"I want to emphasize that, well, most of our peer companies have benefited both in terms of revenue growth and margin expansion from price increases, Ours has been driven primarily by the change in revenue mix, which is favoring these higher-value products.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-05-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ross Seymore","x":"And does the fact that you didn't raise prices as much as your peers and that you had availability, is that giving you longer-term design wins, higher value design wins?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"And keep in mind that weâve had one price increase, and that was in February this year for 5%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2022-08-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tore Svanberg","x":"But you mentioned that 5% price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"In the enterprise data we’ve really got good traction with the GPUs for artificial intelligence and so that should really be one of our growth drivers in the first half of 2023.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-02-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"And I may have left you with an incorrect impression because Enterprise Data is likely to go down even though GPU, AI will improve.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2022 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-02-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"So while many companies use this supply-demand imbalance as an opportunity to raise prices to their customers, we only had one single-digit price increase back in February and all of the other is representative of higher ASPs and volume gains.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Hsing","x":"The GPU part came in the AI side, we have a current design win and as well as the next design, and the futures we will release end of the year or next year.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-05-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Hsing","x":"Well, also the storage -- in the AI segment in the -- in data center, if we -- the computing segment is maybe is flattish, okay?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q3","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Hsing","x":"We are still the leading -- would be next year and the year after, all these products are eyeing in development with our customers and with the leading-edge -- leading providers in AI GPUs specifically.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q3","e":"mpwr","d":"2023-10-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Bernie Blegen","x":"I think, Tore, you hit on a couple of very good points that as far as the AI GPU opportunity, we're very well positioned both for the near term, in 2024, but more importantly, longer term.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2024-02-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Quinn Bolton","x":"As you look into 2024, can you just talk about your expectations for enterprise data specifically your opportunity to perhaps expand the customer set with some of the other leading GPU and AI accelerator companies?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2023 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2024-02-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Quinn Bolton","x":"Just wanted to follow-up, Bernie, I think you had mentioned that in addition to the GPU and AI, you guys are starting to see better traction on just the core CPU server market I know in the past, you've talked about your goal to try to get your share in that segment to 25%.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2024 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2024-05-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tore Svanberg","x":"There's been some chatter lately about lower power management content in next-generation AI data centers due to liquid cooling and other techniques to lower overall power.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2024 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2024-05-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Hsing","x":"I can't talk about the -- well I don't -- we don't know how our customers -- and these are AI GPU providers, how they use it.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2024 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2024-08-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Hsing","x":"And there's a very few company using a silicon based, the module solution to power up this AI solution or data centers.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Kelsey Chia","x":"So I believe that segment is also benefiting from the AI infrastructure build-outs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tore Svanberg","x":"I was hoping you could talk a little bit about those efforts, especially given the current tariff environment.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Quinn Bolton","x":"Are you starting to see either tariff costs and/or pricing pressure?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tony Balow","x":"We expanded our customer base in data centers for power solutions across AI, server, memory, optical modules, and switch applications with leading-edge current density, power efficiency, and packaging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/monolithic-power-mpwr-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael Hsing","x":"I think to go back to part of your question, which had to do with the traditional maybe CPU data center, the lines between AI, GPUs, and CPU are getting pretty blurry because they're so integral to one another these days.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/monolithic-power-mpwr-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2025 Q4","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-02-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Balow","x":"Great design wins, great engagement with tier ones and OEMs, but whether it's tariffs, whether it's the end of EV subsidies, or whether you even talk about what the impact on the auto market is from the memory shortage, think we know.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/05/monolithic-power-mpwr-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Hsing","x":"In these AI and in GPU powers in a given time will be the performance and also the manufacturing capabilities and reliability will remain as only a few players.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/mpwr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-04-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Hsing","x":"And the other one is the AI side, the compute side, for power the GPUs, okay.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/mpwr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Balow","x":"And in those cases, yes, you could see us raise prices to stay within our gross margin model.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/mpwr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q1","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-04-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Hsing","x":"These are passive semiconductor pass-through device.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/mpwr-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Tony Balow","x":"We began sampling high voltage AC-to-DC products for 800-volt data center architectures as an expand beyond our current AI and server core power solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/monolithic-power-systems-mpwr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Sebastian Naj","x":"AI data center is clearly a strong tailwind for the enterprise data business, also in communications.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/monolithic-power-systems-mpwr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q2","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Michael R. Hsing","x":"So in terms of whether due to the price increase, definitely, it is not. it is all products.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/07/30/monolithic-power-systems-mpwr-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q3","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Tony Balow","x":"And I think over time, as you start to see even stronger growth in GPU potentially driven by the Agentic AI workloads, that's going to be even a further tailwind out in time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/30/monolithic-power-systems-mpwr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MPWR 2026 Q3","e":"mpwr","d":"2026-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Sebastien Cyrus Naji","x":"…maybe just ask my first question, given some of the news around integrated voltage regulators and the acquisition of Empower by Analog Devices, maybe could you just give us your view on this technology and whether you see it as a competitive risk in the AI data center or the larger data center?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transc